  "ingredients": [
    "12 ounces kielbasa sausage",
    "1.5 cups dark brown sugar",
    "2 tablespoons Dijon mustard",
    "1.5 tablespoons apple cider vinegar",
    "1 pinch ground black pepper"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat your oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qm-JO1yLg-wcXCcszji_D8qmoW0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8539179-tiktok-candied-kielbasa-bites-VAT-step-01-9440183693de44be91ad5683ef55bbf8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8539179/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut kielbasa into 3 to 4 large sections, then each section in half lengthwise. Slice each section into half moons about a half-inch long.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TK4QVEvLViYd0FPao4h0D0xOHQ8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8539179-tiktok-candied-kielbasa-bites-VAT-step-02-0de759238861493592559a13d82d32cd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8539179/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine brown sugar, mustard, vinegar, and pepper in a medium saucepan. Set over low heat and cook, stirring, until the sugar has dissolved completely. Stir in kielbasa.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/49tbrHeSFWxmVSar3TaBbFvj5NU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8539179-tiktok-candied-kielbasa-bites-VAT-step-03-1-b56015b27f4d47b897f9e76a61a923b3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8539179/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Line a sheet pan with parchment paper. With a slotted spoon, transfer the kielbasa pieces from the pot and spread evenly over the parchment paper. Set aside leftover sauce in the pot.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lPbAGmdgJVbeWc1QYax3H89yMMo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8539179-tiktok-candied-kielbasa-bites-VAT-step-04-2-2353a8b124c1437cb32a08a7b3800e1f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8539179/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake for 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/naLOCy9F_SmkiPyfbSrlLH-vUDY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8539179-tiktok-candied-kielbasa-bites-VAT-step-05-8cccec0daeef4fd291df12a78dcf77c7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8539179/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from oven, then carefully lift up the parchment paper and funnel kielbasa pieces back into the pot of sauce. Stir to coat again.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/37v9ti30T460ZTqCO2QqpsR6V8w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8539179-tiktok-candied-kielbasa-bites-VAT-step-06-0b90e75dcf794f6981dbf6287a76acc7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8539179/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Repeat the process of putting the kielbasa pieces back on the parchment-lined sheet pan. Bake for another 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bPoRg3tdwQcaZJJoG_mCg2Ax9Z8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8539179-tiktok-candied-kielbasa-bites-VAT-step-07-9187717e79294857ae9b41d4940d601d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8539179/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer to a serving platter and serve with toothpicks.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EHxw0UmQ-bSV-oOxFkyibTxTf9k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8539179-tiktok-candied-kielbasa-bites-VAT-4x3-2-2224e4e04c73415c8aa1e31514791a4d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8539179/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
